# Supplier paperwork. The quote carries a shipping address, a bank account and
# a GST number, so it stays out of the repo - especially if this ever gets
# pushed somewhere public. The figures it supplies live in src/lib/pricing.
# Everything the project was built from but which must not be published:
# supplier quotes, invoices, reference cut files, the pre-squash git history.
# See local-only/README.md.
local-only/

# Belt and braces. These file types have only ever arrived here as supplier
# paperwork or exports, so an accidental one in the root stays out too.
*.pdf
*.dxf
*.zip
*.mp4
*.webm

# Local Claude Code config. Carries test credentials and paths into other
# projects on this machine, none of which belong in a repo that goes public.
.claude/

# Browser-automation scratch: screenshots, DXF exports and zips from testing.
# Several megabytes of artefacts that say nothing a reader needs.
.playwright-mcp/
